# Tracked placeholder: src/spa.rs embeds frontend/dist/ with rust-embed, so the directory
# must exist for the backend to compile -- a fresh clone that has never run a frontend
# build still has to build. Vite empties dist/ on every build, which deleted this file and
# let a `git add -A` commit the deletion (it happened once, in 6ed9399); frontend/public/
# now carries a copy so each build puts it straight back.
!frontend/dist/.gitkeep
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
.superpowers/
graphify-out/
